{
  "name": "projects-det (projects page, seeded ecosystem, operator + builder; the agents tab and the documents section drive their detach confirm and cancel it)",
  "stopOnError": false,
  "notes": [
    "The tasks tab's attach-agents CTA renders only on a project with no linked agent, and both seeded projects link one, so the tail creates a project through the dialog (which is also the only way to play new-project-create and new-project-close) and drives the CTA there. The same throwaway project then receives the document attachments: project-doc-attach-empty-btn and project-doc-attach-btn open the native picker through plugin:dialog|open, which a stubInvoke answers with two files the seed places under ${HOME}/.apollia (upload_project_document tolerates any readable file), then with null for the cancelled picker. Nothing later reads that project's documents.",
    "The load-error panel needs a rejected list_projects AND an empty projects store (Projects.svelte hides it once the store holds rows, and QuickPicker fills that store from any earlier chat section of master-det). The block therefore arms two once-stubs on list_projects: the first answers [] and empties the store on the first visit, the second rejects on the visit after a detour through the dashboard; the retry then reaches the backend and repaints the seeded list before the rest of the book.",
    "project-agent-error-details and project-doc-error-details are native <details> summaries inside the ErrorBanner; each is reached by a once-stub rejecting list_project_agents (re-mounting the agents tab from the conversations tab, whose own mount never calls it) and delete_project_document (around the armed detach the book already plays). Nothing persists: the rejected read leaves the links alone and the rejected delete never reached the row.",
    "project-agent-add-btn links onboarding-agent (installed, not attached to Seed Project Alpha) and the block removes that link through the row's own confirm, so the two seeded links the earlier steps assert are untouched."
  ],
  "dynamicTestids": [
    "project-agent-remove-cancel-seed-classifier",
    "project-agent-remove-confirm-onboarding-agent",
    "project-agent-remove-confirm-seed-classifier",
    "project-agent-remove-onboarding-agent",
    "project-agent-remove-seed-classifier",
